Grok Build
Copyright 2023-2026 SpaceXAI
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
https://github.com/xai-org/grok-build

Meridian's durable plan-document workflow borrows architecture and interaction
patterns from Grok Build's file-backed plan mode, including treating the plan as
a document, applying incremental edits before submission, and presenting a
review boundary after the document has been updated.


Modifications made:
  - scoped each plan document to a Meridian conversation and planning episode
    instead of placing one shared plan file in the workspace
  - added immutable SQLite revisions, crash recovery, atomic file
    materialisation, inline review comments, and editable user suggestions
  - retained patch-only Native updates while adapting full-snapshot ACP agents
    to the same review model
  - integrated the workflow with Meridian's transcript, attention queue,
    remote client and mobile navigation
